      "writtenOn": "2015-04-28T00:26:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the DMA mapping is not the same as samus_pd which uses f072. You need to look up the DMA mapping for f051. unfortunately the 051 only has 5 DMA channels, 4 of which we need for PD communication, and the last (chan 1) is not useful for anything. so, we have to disable UART DMA. I think for this board, the desired mapping should be:\n\n/*\n * the DMA mapping is :\n *  Chan 2 : TIM1_CH1  (C0 RX)\n *  Chan 3 : SPI1_TX   (C0 TX)\n *  Chan 4 : TIM3_CH1  (C1 RX)\n *  Chan 5 : SPI2_TX   (C1 TX)\n */\n\nthen you do not need to remap any of the DMAs, so leave STM32_SYSCFG_CFGR1 alone",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 227,
        "endChar": 68
      },
